# AIRC Public Preview License

**Version 1.0 — October 21, 2026**

**The preview ends at 23:59:59 UTC on May 1, 2027.**

AIRC is experimental and under active development. The purpose of this license is to give everyone broad rights to implement, test and build on the protocol while it is being developed and refined, so that the design can be proven in use before its terms are settled. It lets anyone try AIRC, implement it, and use it commercially or privately during the preview, subject to the terms below. There is no charge for these permissions. The preview is a development period, not an indication of the terms that will follow it; continuing afterward will require whatever license the Licensor then offers.

